# THE BREAK (law 3): code outside model.tree erases a note by making the erase event itself and stepping it, with no
# permit and no `grant-delete`. `event` is `mark hide` in model.tree, so the make is refused as `hidden-make`
load ./model
  find natural
  find rank
  find shelf
  find event
  find step

task erase-anyway
  take s, like shelf
  take who, like natural
  take id, like natural
  like shelf
  back
    step
      read s
      make erase
        bind who, who
        bind rank, make member
        bind id, id
